Arara Code: extension-controlled visibility and direct panel launcher menu.

Why a patch: stable and proposed extension APIs cannot change built-in view
when clauses, remove native menubar submenus or insert a selector beside panel
tabs. The extension owns onboarding, mode persistence, platform labels and process
execution. This patch only adds the arara.ui.hideAdvanced context gate and a
menu calling arara.terminal.platforms / arara.terminal.openPlatform,
anchored 5 px from the launcher button using the standard workbench theme.
No process, filesystem or network execution occurs in the core hook.
Touches: outline/output/markers/debug contributions, tunnel view descriptor,
menubar contribution, panel part and panel CSS.

